  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "You may have noticed an inactive GameObject in the <b>Hierarchy</b> window named <b>Tube_Slide.</b> Unfortunately, this tube slide is broken into three pieces and needs to be assembled \u2014 that\u2019s your job! \n\nThis optional challenge is classified as Expert difficulty."
